Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:26:34 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 18/26] Safarium: say Safarium instead of Chromium; drop two
 Settings leftovers

ResourceBundle replaces the product name "Chromium" with "Safarium" in
localized strings (Settings, dialogs, menus), keeping it where the text
means the open source project: "The Chromium Authors", "the Chromium
open source project", "Chromium OS" and the "Chromium <version>" engine
line on the About page.

Settings > Autofill: no "Loyalty cards" chip under Payments, and the
"Related Google services" section (only a duplicate Password Manager
link in Safarium) is hidden.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
